    <string name="security_info_dialog_title">Security &amp; Privacy Architecture</string>
    <string name="security_info_dialog_content">NextGen Messages is designed with on-device privacy as a fundamental priority:\n\n• App Lock: Uses PBKDF2WithHmacSHA256 with 100,000 iterations and constant-time verification. Rate limiting prevents brute force attacks.\n\n• Biometrics: Leverages standard AndroidX BiometricPrompt.\n\n• Private Conversations: Application-level access control that hides previews and requires authentication. Note: System Telephony Provider rows remain accessible to other default SMS clients or privileged apps.\n\n• Window Privacy: FLAG_SECURE prevents screen recording and thumbnail generation in Recents.\n\n• Encrypted Backups: Authenticated AES-256-GCM encryption with PBKDF2 key derivation. Your backup password is never stored or uploaded.</string>
